{% comment %}
  Flat-vector chilli/botanical cluster used to frame the hero's centred
  copy (left side). Filled two-tone shapes — deep brand red, a warmer
  chilli red and dark charcoal — rather than the thin line-art used by the
  older deco-* snippets, so it reads as illustration rather than doodle.

  Ids are suffixed -a so this can sit on the same page as cluster-b
  without the two <use> references colliding.
{% endcomment %}
<svg viewBox="0 0 300 640" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <defs>
    <g id="hd-chili-a">
      <path d="M32 14C46 14 54 26 54 42C54 70 40 100 26 118C21 124 12 121 12 112C12 90 20 62 27 44C31 33 33 22 32 14Z" fill="currentColor"/>
      <path d="M32 15C30 6 35 1 44 2" stroke="#22303F" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </g>
    <g id="hd-leaf-a">
      <path d="M2 20C16 3 44 0 58 8C46 30 18 38 2 20Z" fill="currentColor"/>
    </g>
  </defs>

  {% comment %} Stems the fruit hangs from {% endcomment %}
  <path d="M-6 636C58 546 44 432 92 336C132 256 126 168 74 96" stroke="#22303F" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <path d="M26 640C78 572 96 486 78 398" stroke="#C2311B" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <path d="M120 620C150 548 146 470 118 408" stroke="#22303F" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>

  {% comment %} Curl detail, echoing the reference's spiral tendrils {% endcomment %}
  <path d="M52 300C34 292 26 272 38 258C48 246 68 250 70 266C72 280 58 288 48 282" stroke="#C2311B" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>

  <g color="#C2311B">
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(4 60) rotate(-16) scale(0.95)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(120 138) rotate(22) scale(0.8)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(24 386) rotate(-8) scale(1.05)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(146 470) rotate(28) scale(0.85)"/>
  </g>
  <g color="#9D0101">
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(96 236) rotate(-24) scale(0.9)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(-14 210) rotate(14) scale(0.75)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(74 508) rotate(-18) scale(1)"/>
  </g>
  <g color="#22303F">
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(168 320) rotate(34) scale(0.62)"/>
    <use href="#hd-chili-a" transform="translate(-10 470) rotate(-30) scale(0.58)"/>
  </g>

  <g color="#22303F">
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(96 120) rotate(-38)"/>
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(30 268) rotate(158) scale(0.9)"/>
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(150 420) rotate(-22) scale(0.85)"/>
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(52 596) rotate(196) scale(0.8)"/>
  </g>
  <g color="#C2311B">
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(140 200) rotate(24) scale(0.7)"/>
    <use href="#hd-leaf-a" transform="translate(8 348) rotate(172) scale(0.75)"/>
  </g>

  <circle cx="176" cy="96" r="9" fill="#9D0101"/>
  <circle cx="196" cy="126" r="6" fill="#22303F"/>
  <circle cx="14" cy="160" r="7" fill="#C2311B"/>
  <circle cx="188" cy="392" r="8" fill="#9D0101"/>
  <circle cx="118" cy="566" r="6" fill="#C2311B"/>
  <circle cx="164" cy="574" r="9" fill="#22303F"/>

  {% comment %}
    Product-resonant accents woven into the cluster: a tamarind pod (Imli
    Chutney), a tomato (the chutney base), and a star anise (Garam
    Masala). Tamarind gets the warm brown the theme already uses as the
    Imli accent (#B5651D) — everything else stays in the cluster palette.
  {% endcomment %}
  <g transform="translate(148 34) rotate(24)">
    <path d="M0 12C4 2 14 -2 22 2C28 -2 38 0 42 6C48 2 58 8 57 16C56 24 48 27 42 25C38 31 28 32 23 27C15 32 3 28 0 18Z" fill="#B5651D"/>
    <path d="M1 10C-3 6 -4 1 -1 -3" stroke="#22303F" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  </g>
  <g transform="translate(204 210)">
    <circle r="14" fill="#C2311B"/>
    <path d="M-9 -10C-4 -5 4 -5 9 -10C4 -13 -4 -13 -9 -10Z" fill="#22303F"/>
    <path d="M0 -11V-18" stroke="#22303F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="-5" cy="-3" r="3" fill="#FBF3E7" opacity="0.45"/>
  </g>
  <g transform="translate(60 524) scale(0.9)">
    <g fill="#22303F">
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(45)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(90)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(135)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(180)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(225)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(270)"/>
      <ellipse cx="0" cy="-13" rx="4.5" ry="11" transform="rotate(315)"/>
    </g>
    <circle r="5" fill="#C2311B"/>
  </g>
</svg>
